# ============================================================
# WorldMeshes - generated terrain data
# ============================================================

# Everything below Generated/ can be recreated by the tool.
Generated/


# ============================================================
# WorldMeshes - authoring height tiles
# ============================================================

# Committed authoring height tiles can be regenerated/recreated
# by the terrain authoring tools and should not be stored in Git.
#
# This ignores the contents of the Tiles folder while allowing
# Unity's Authoring/Height/Tiles.meta file to remain tracked.
Authoring/Height/Tiles/


